 "name_en": "Direct Procurement with Inbound Delivery (2TX)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Direct Procurement with Inbound Delivery (2TX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Starting with the creation of a purchase order, the actual supply situation can be monitored and planned. The subsequent creation of an inbound delivery enables the user to process enhanced procurement processes including the goods receipt and the putaway. The procurement process is enclosed with the creation of a supplier invoice.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage purchase orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor supplier confirmations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage inbound deliveries</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Detect critical situations automatically</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Streamline procurement processes in an efficient and cost-effective manner</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure highly automated processes for the procurement of direct materials</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce manual effort greatly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor the procurement progress in real-time</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use an analytical list page to monitor purchase order items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automated detection of critical situations</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过入库交货直接采购 (2TX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">从创建采购订单开始，可以监控和计划实际供应情况。通过后续创建入库交货，用户可以处理增强的采购流程，包括收货和入库。采购流程随附于供应商发票的创建。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控供应商确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理入库交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动检测严重情况</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7c14fa8332374495b34a0bdf31b0eb59__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">以经济有效的方式简化采购流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保直接物料采购的高度自动化流程。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">大幅减少手动工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">实时监控采购进度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用分析列表页面监控订购单项目。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动检测紧急情况</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
